<div class="sec"><div class="wrap"><div class="head"><span class="eyebrow rv">What we believe</span><h2 class="split">Four things we hold ourselves to.</h2></div>
<div class="g4">
<div class="card rv"><span class="tag">Show the work</span><h3>Nothing hidden</h3><p>Public playbook, working software every two weeks, and a site you can inspect with Blueprint mode.</p></div>
<div class="card rv" style="--d:80ms"><span class="tag">Measure, don't claim</span><h3>Numbers with sources</h3><p>If we can't show how we measured it, we don't say it.</p></div>
<div class="card rv" style="--d:160ms"><span class="tag">Built to hand over</span><h3>No lock-in</h3><p>Software that's easy to run, grow and own without us.</p></div>
<div class="card rv" style="--d:240ms"><span class="tag">Accessible by default</span><h3>Software for everyone</h3><p>Accessibility is part of every release, not a project at the end.</p></div>
</div></div></div>
